 "convoLines": [
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I don't know what to do with my hands today.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Irving shows you where they go to think. \"Don't tell the others. Everyone needs one place.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I — yeah. It helps, hearing that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"What got you through the first week? The very first days.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Take your time.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on that question.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Alright — I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Have you — sorry. I keep thinking about them. Just... be straight with me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Wei has an edge today — something curdled."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They grin when they spot you — unguarded, for once."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They shake their head, then nod — both true at once. \"Talk to me a bit. That helps more than anything.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"We lost Franz and Mia. I do the headcount without thinking. Then I think.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"...Fine. This had better be worth it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I check everyone's shoes for wear at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"A name. Okay.\" You say it out loud, trying the shape of it:"
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "🤝 \"The Company.\" It hangs in the air a moment — then Irving grins. It's real now. It has a name, which means it can be lost."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "🤝 Wei is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. \"Huh.\" They turn it over in their mind. \"I'll remember that one.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Thanks for... you know. Just listening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"It's quiet today. Wrong kind of quiet.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Heh. Nobody's asked me that in a while. ...I'm alright. Getting there.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Franz is gone and Mia is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Mia said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. They nod slowly, committing it to memory. \"Good to know. Really good to know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They speak. You understand none of it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod back, slowly."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. They smile back, slower this time, like it just landed."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They answer at length. You point at yourself, then at them, then at the fire. Together. They get it."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "You lean in, catching the rise and fall of it. Sounds, and the shape of meaning just out of reach."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Hm. Almost.\" Chantal corrects the one word, gently, like setting a bone. \"Again.\" You say it right. They nod, satisfied with both of you."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "Something eases in their shoulders. They're really talking to you now."
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 44,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Please — whatever this is, it's getting worse — I'm achy and wrung out, barely keeping food down. Can you do anything?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"The fever's not breaking and I'm barely keeping food down. I need help — real help, not just water.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "Move next to them, on the same side of the Haven door, to help."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Since Franz died... I keep expecting to see Franz at the fire. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I keep turning over the last thing Franz said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"I should get back to it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 47,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"We never finished talking about grief — we wandered off it, 4 days back. 'I — yeah. It helps, hearing that.'\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Come see what I found. You won't believe it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Halfway to the hollow, Irving freezes. Fresh tracks — big. \"We go back now. Quietly.\" You do. The wild, reminding you."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Thanks. ...Thanks for saying that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"I dreamed Franz was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"I taste the water before the others drink. It doesn't bring anyone back. It just keeps my hands from shaking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Wei nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"We bury, we grieve, we keep going. There's no step four.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them Wild Ramps — where it grows, how to tell it apart. Their eyes widen. \"I never knew that.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Right. Done. Don't look so relieved.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"What's something from your old life that's actually useful here? I mean it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Not dumb at all. The people who can't wait are the ones who make mistakes. You're an asset.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Well. Still on your useful old-life skills.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Franz owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Sleep's gone strange. I pace while thinking at odd hours now. Whatever gets me to morning.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "Irving nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You show them Black Walnut — where it grows, how to tell it apart. A short laugh. \"And I've been walking past it for weeks.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"And... scene. Good talk.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 48,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"You talk to it -- the System. Have you ever asked? About the taken -- about Amira?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for telling me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"It's my niece, Amira. Is napping in a pod somewhere, they say. Seven years old and napping. She was never boring. The pods get into my sleep some nights. Row on row of them, humming like a held note -- and I wake up reaching for something that isn't there.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good question.\" \"Last time things were different. They always are.\" \"They took Xavier — Hardened Duel, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"What's this about? Like I said — we're still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"All right. Thank you for asking.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Xavier nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I've got things to do. People to avoid. You know.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Thanks for listening. Most people change the subject.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good — what's been happening, settled. Feels better said out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"About that question — So what's your plan here? Just... get through it? Anyway, that's me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Hah. Honest. I can work with honest.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Still on your plan here.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Forget I said anything. What did you want?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took me. Hardened Duel — up there, on the screens, in front of everyone. I'm still turning it over.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I do the small things right. The big things notice.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "Irving nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"I should go before I say something sincere.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Good talk. I feel like I know you a little better now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They spread their hands, smiling — the words are missing, but the meaning lands anyway."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They answer at length. They nod back, a little quicker this time. \"Water?\" — they grin, proud of the one English they know."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They answer at length. A smile, tired but real."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "They answer at length. You press a hand to your own chest, then point at them. Together — they get it."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "You listen hard, watching their mouth shape the words. Sounds, and the shape of meaning just out of reach."
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 55,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"I tried the Wild Ramps like you showed me. Didn't poison anyone, so that's a win.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They light up a little when they see you."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Anyway.\" A small smile."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Still on that plant lesson.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"We're down to 0 liters of clean water. I can't carry enough alone. First light, the creek, you and me?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 0 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"No, yeah, of course. Forget I asked.\" They won't forget. They'll just stop asking."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Okay. We'll pick this up later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"No — you're right, it's a lot. Forget it.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that taken person.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"No, really — it's handled. Thanks for asking, though.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "They glance at the fire, then back. The quiet doesn't seem to bother them."
  },
  {
   "day": 71,
   "text": "\"Sure. I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Can I tell you something? I can't read, and I'm scared it matters now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"The cistern's nearly dry — 6 liters left. I need someone to haul water with me at first light. Two of us, half the trips. Will you come?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"6 liters. That's today's drinking water, and then we're boiling creek water and hoping. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "As I said — Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Right. I get it.\" A beat — and then the subject is closed. They won't raise it again."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"I should go. You know where to find me.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Forget I asked. I'll figure it out.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to that water haul.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Good timing. I was just thinking about you.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Walk my trap line with me? Extra hands, extra eyes.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "Xavier shows you where they go to think. \"Don't tell the others. Everyone needs one place.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"I checked the cistern three times hoping I misread it. 3 liters. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "🤝 Xavier is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"We were just talking. Nothing important.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Huh. I answered that once — back when the answer was simpler.\" \"Windfall. They just... took Hind and Irving. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"That's... pretty much all of it, honestly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"So.\" They look at the fire for a moment."
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"Right. Go on, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 86,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I saved you a spot. Sit.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"I still need help with the creek water run.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "🤝 Xavier is 👁️ Scout now. Sees trouble first. Warns the party on the road."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Like I said — We were just talking. Nothing important.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They hear the warmth in it. They're not ready to let it in."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Sure — what's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Esmeralda always took the burnt piece. Said someone had to. I take it now.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Never mind the sickness I'm fighting — we got it handled. Thanks anyway. The cistern's nearly dry — 0 liters left. I need someone to haul water with me at first light. Two of us, half the trips. Will you come?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Do the math with me: 0 liters, 8 people. That's not tomorrow's water. We walk together and each carry two liters back. Creek water still needs boiling.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Move next to your partner, on the same side of the Haven door."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Sorry — I shouldn't load that on you. What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Huh. Let me think about that.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Esmeralda owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"My part? I remember them. Someone has to do it properly.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "Xavier nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They nod slowly, not quite done, not quite continuing."
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Still on what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Do you still sing? ...Sorry — weird question. I just realized I haven't heard anyone sing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Ha! The creek concerts. I've heard those. Keep going.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "\"It's been a while. Glad we circled back to what's been happening.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 94,
   "text": "They're smiling as you go. \"Come back anytime.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Somewhere out there, someone's having a worse day. I find that deeply comforting.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Come get air with me. I need to think out loud.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "On the way, Xavier stops and actually teaches you something — how they read a slope for water, how their grandmother did it. (Knowledge, freely given. The Codex notes it.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"I still need a hand with the creek water run.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Roles. Not ranks — promises.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Hind nods, stepping back. \"Scout is yours now.\" (Roles are promises. There's only one of each.)"
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "As I said — Your partner is inside the Haven hall. Go through the door to meet them."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"We were just talking. Nothing important. That's still where we are.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Something in them almost softens — then doesn't. Not yet."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Yeah? What's up?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"They took me. Hollow Belly — up there, on the screens, in front of everyone. I'm still turning it over.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "You say nothing. Neither do they, for a while — and it's fine."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Oh — okay. Later, then.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"...Think about it? I'll be around.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Okay, but what about Can I tell you something? I'm practicing what I would say if I ever saw my family again. I haven't told anyone.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Hind seems lighter — something good landed recently."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "Their whole posture softens around you."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Well.\" A breath. \"That's where things stand.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Still on what they confided.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Don't tell anyone I told you. What's on your mind?\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"You asked me that before. It's a different question now.\" \"Hollow Belly. They just... took Chantal and Ava. Came back like nothing happened. It wasn't nothing.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"That's the whole of it. Sorry.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "A comfortable quiet settles. They smile a little, and let it be."
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"Alright. Catch you later.\""
  },
  {
   "day": 105,
   "text": "\"This was good.\" They mean it."
  }
 ],
