    "bearerSample": [
     "🚶 Leo is back — found Esmeralda."
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "You notice the village gives you room on the path now. Not fear, exactly. Room.",
     "💛 You hold Grandma's Tin Cup. Grandma drank her coffee from this on the porch every morning for sixty years, rain or shine, and always poured a finger's worth onto the ground first — 'for the ones wh",
     "You give Irving 3 portions of Pawpaw, with the village watching. They look at you differently now."
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "Riders on the ridge — no, a cart. A TRADER. Word travels: Haven has food, and where there's food there's trade.",
     "◈ WORD TRAVELS — riders from The Hungry Road bring talk of Haven. Out there they call you the Indispensable. Other villages send envoys now. They need what you know.",
     "Ava showed Irving the broad shady tree with feathery leaves and hanging brown pods — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."
    ],
    "crisisSample": [
     "🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10",
     "🐗 This one came with the raid on Haven — it was with the teeth at the door, not a lone wanderer.",
     "SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves."
    ]
   },
