    "crisisN": 20,
    "otherN": 296,
    "bearerSample": [
     "Irving has been asking about the strange leaves all week — \"but what IS it?\" Tonight, an answer. Leo is showing everyone Chinese Chestnut by the fire. \"See the leaves? Like that. Don't mix it up.\" The",
     "The Codex doesn't pause for grief. Irving blinks — and it's already there, overlaying everything, syncing. No pen. No paper. The mantle just... transfers.",
     "📖 The Codex turns a page: Esmeralda Levy, 90 days. The mantle passes to Irving Webb."
    ],
    "giftSample": [
     "The System's gifts are hungry: -85 kcal metabolic cost. Feed the power or lose it.",
     "The northwest ground is thinning faster than your crews alone could strip it. Ashford isn't slowing down — their foragers are on your turf most days now. Their speaker would probably want words. (Talk",
     "📖 LEARNED: Animal Behavior (Level 1). Most animals flee. Give them an escape route and they take it. Cornered animals fight."
    ],
    "rumorSample": [
     "A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.",
     "Ava showed Hind the giant emergent tree dropping heavy cannonball pods the size of a head — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools.",
     "Xavier showed Chantal the giant emergent tree dropping heavy cannonball pods the size of a head — \"remember it.\" Word travels before the lesson cools."
    ],
    "crisisSample": [
     "◈ THE TABLE — the ring of pale light flickers at the edge of the sky... and does not come. Not yet. The table is being set for those whose deeds are done, and yours are not done. The ledger still want",
     "SYSTEM: Naming things. Very human. The audience approves.",
     "You camp wild tonight — no hall meal, but the pantry still reaches you through System requisition. Eat from your pack tonight."
    ]
   },
   "eventClass": "handoff"
