  "echoSample": [
   "d44: \"We lost Franz and Mia. I do the headcount without thinking. Then I think.\"",
   "d44: \"Franz is gone and Mia is gone and the world just... continues. That's the part I can't stand.\"",
   "d47: \"Since Franz died... I keep expecting to see Franz at the fire. Stupid.\"",
   "d47: \"I keep turning over the last thing Franz said to me. I can't tell if I'm remembering it right, and that's somehow the worst part.\"",
   "d48: \"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"I dreamed Franz was still here. Woke up angry at the dream. Stupid.\"",
   "d48: \"You want to know about that? Okay.\" \"Franz owed me a favor. I keep thinking about collecting. Stupid.\""
